  return arr.filter((item, index) => arr.indexOf(item) === index);
}
```

Note: both approaches use strict equality (`===`), so they won't dedupe objects by content — `[{a: 1}, {a: 1}]` stays as-is. For that, you'd dedupe on a key like `JSON.stringify(item)`.

